AWS EC2 Instance/Image Export Task  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1537
Detects export of an instance or image to S3 (CreateInstanceExportTask/ExportImage), which can stage a full VM image for exfiltration.
False positives: Legitimate VM export/migration workflows.
Source: rules/exfiltration/ec2-create-instance-export-task.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
```
eventName IN ("CreateInstanceExportTask", "ExportImage") eventSource="ec2.amazonaws.com"
